=== Lattice Point Membership Test ===

Lattice with basis:
  b1 = (3, 1)
  b2 = (1, 2)

Testing points:
  (4, 3): YES (in lattice)
  (3, 0): NO
  (6, 2): YES (in lattice)
  (2, 4): YES (in lattice)
  (0, 0): YES (in lattice)

Verification:
  (4, 3) = 1*(3,1) + 1*(1,2) = (3+1, 1+2) = (4, 3) -> YES
  (6, 2) = 2*(3,1) + 0*(1,2) = (6, 2) -> YES
  (2, 4) = 0*(3,1) + 2*(1,2) = (2, 4) -> YES
  (3, 0) cannot be written as integer combo -> NO
